Z||000003||avengador1||11-02-2001||09:56 AM||||As I recall the speedometer in an 84 is an 85 MPH unit. You can buy a 140 MPH unit from IRM or I have seen 120 MPH glue on faces, but those would require that you change the resistor to make it work right.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
